    "title": "Matrix Medical Network and HealthFair to Pay $56.5 Million Over False Medicare Claims - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matt Richards ,\n6 hours ago SHERMAN, Texas — Community Care Health Network LLC, operating as Matrix Medical Network, and DPN USA, doing business as HealthFair, have agreed to a $56.5 million settlement over allegations of submitting false diagnosis codes to Medicare Advantage. Matrix will pay $36.5 million to resolve claims in a qui tam... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
